Usage: tool [options] <input> [extra]

Copies files around

Arguments:
  <input>               the input file
  <extra>               an optional second file

Options:
  -v, --verbose         more output
  -q, --quiet           less output
  -o, --output <value>  where to write (default: out.txt)
  -n, --count <value>   how many
  -h, --help            show this help and exit
